# Enrichment Implementation Guide

**Full plan:** `docs/ENRICHMENT_PLAN.md` — read it first.
**Input:** `data/raw/{episode_id}/extracted_data.json` (already exists from scraping phase)
**Output:** `data/raw/{episode_id}/mood_enriched.json`

---

## File map

```
backend/enrichment/
  __init__.py
  text_formatter.py   ← NEW — pure function, no ML imports
  mood_tagger.py      ← NEW — loads DeBERTa, runs classification, writes output
  __main__.py         ← NEW — plain Python CLI
```

No changes to `backend/scraping/`. No database. No LangGraph.

